    "description": "A walk round Somers Town by locals founders  of a museum to preserve an area that feels at risk of extinction.\r\n\r\nA Space for Us – People’s Museum Somers Town is a space to preserve local voice and the area; to celebrate an incredible ‘radical, reformers and uncommon people’s‘ histories, to record the change now, as well as to campaign and preserve local working class heritage.",
