    "factsheet": [
        {
            "heading": "An insider guided walk - help us record heat + housing!",
            "paragraphs": [
                "Led by local residents who can tell you what it is like to live in this area subject to huge development and whose passion founded a museum! the walk begins at the museum where its displays,, films and stories gathered over 10 years can be viewed.  An interactive walk with your photos my contribute to an exhibition about urban heat islands - something very relevant to our recent heatwaves and to Somers Town which has little green space - hear how the 1930s housing design 'for life' contributed to better living. Support the museum project - books, teas and coffees available."
            ]
        }
